Package: nouveau-hpd-ddc-dkms
Version: 0.1.11
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, build-essential, patch, python3, binutils, bzip2, xz-utils, zstd, linux-source
Maintainer: Local Administrator <root@localhost>
Description: DKMS rebuild of Ubuntu Nouveau with HPD/DDC fix and diagnostics
 Builds Nouveau from matching Ubuntu kernel sources and applies the maintained
 HPD-low/DDC patch. Optional read-only PNVIO diagnostics, DAC load-detect
 probing, the opt-in GK104 K4200 hardware DDC diagnostic, and the read-only
 GK104 POST/GPIO31 interpreter trace are available.
